WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:08.370
Look, I didn't want to be a half blood. Being
a half blood is dangerous.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:09.750
It's scary.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:16.500
Most of the time it gets you killed in
painful, nasty ways.

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:24.700
If you think you might be one of us, my
advice is turn away while you still can.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:32.240
Because once you know what you are. You'll
sense it too. They'll come for you.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:36.510
Don't say I didn't warn you.

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:53.840
My name is Percy Jackson. I'm 12 years old.
Am I a troubled kid?

00:00:55.830 --> 00:01:02.330
Yeah, you could say that. Bad grades,
bullies, all the normal stuff.

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:10.270
And then there's some other stuff. Some stuff
that's maybe not so normal.

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:26.310
That's me back in second grade. Why was I up
there?

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:28.920
I saw something.

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:34.210
At least I could have sworn I saw something.

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:44.630
When you say you saw something like that, you
wind up in this guy's office. Good news.

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:50.270
He's saying there's nothing to worry about. It's
all in my imagination. But if it happens

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:56.910
again, make sure to tell someone. It happened
again.

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:03.160
These impossible things that felt like they
walked right out of the stories my mom always

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:04.980
told me.

00:02:04.980 --> 00:02:05.940
So real one minute.

00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:10.310
Next...

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:10.940
What a loser.

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:16.640
Hey, fellas, want to come hear about the
imaginary stuff I see? It's not a thing you

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:20.400
want to be saying. To anyone, so I didn't.

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:24.870
Then something changed.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.010
I met Grover.

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:31.770
We had a lot in common.

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:42.490
And not just because we're both at the bottom
of the food chain. And you know what? It felt

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:47.050
good to talk about these things with Grover.
You can almost believe they were imaginary.

00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:49.840
Weird, but harmless.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:55.920
Until the day that changed too.

00:02:57.920 --> 00:02:59.960
Until the day one of them decided to come for me.

